{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>day.txt 是一款極簡的每日筆記應用，為每一天提供獨立頁面以記錄計劃、想法、會議筆記或清單。它摒棄複雜排版與文件夾管理，讓用戶開箱即用，迅速進入書寫狀態。此 App 目前<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價為 US $0.99。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-216.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>本地儲存無廣告干擾</h2>\n<p>筆記透過 iCloud 在 Mac、iPhone 及 iPad 間同步，數據僅存於本地設備，無需額外註冊帳戶且絕不傳送至第三方伺服器。支持離線編輯與搜尋，待重新連線後自動同步變更。內建進度指示點顯示當日時間流逝，並允許將未完成事項標記後自動延續至次日筆記中。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-466-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-467-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-468-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-469-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-470-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-471-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：day.txt</li><li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/day-txt/id6805007155?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T14:18:28.258929+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":291,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T13:52:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T07:37:41.947977+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T14:11:51.376419+00:00","content_hash":"66d0eb4c32ce1c013876db603e3e4f924c59e4a5234c3673e16b2cf4fe95fcfc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}